<h2>Estimate an Incoterm cost split</h2><p class="lead">Apply a simplified Incoterms 2020 payer preset to common cost components, then review or override each allocation before totaling seller and buyer costs.</p>
<div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label for="term">Incoterm 2020 rule</label><select id="term"><option>EXW</option><option>FCA</option><option>FAS</option><option>FOB</option><option>CFR</option><option>CIF</option><option>CPT</option><option>CIP</option><option>DAP</option><option>DPU</option><option>DDP</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="currency">Currency symbol</label><input id="currency" value="$" maxlength="4"></div></div>
<div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Cost component</th><th>Amount</th><th>Payer</th></tr></thead><tbody id="rows"></tbody></table></div>
